<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="f64fecef">&lt;p&gt;
    The report inventory may organize the listing of reports in a variety of ways depending upon the types of reports
    produced. The inventory may include, but is not limited to, reports such as those pertaining to:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Operational
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Financial
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Treasury
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        State Filings
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Bureau Reporting
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Regulatory Compliance
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Statistical
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
